# Implementation Plan: Authentication & Parent/Guardian Emergency Weather Alert System

Add user authentication (Mobile Number / Email ID, live active user count, and user profile) alongside a complete **Parent/Guardian Emergency Weather Alert System** to Mausam without modifying or breaking any existing weather features.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Emergency Notification Dispatch (`/api/emergency/alert`):** To protect API credentials and satisfy requirement #4 ("Never expose API keys, authentication tokens, or secret credentials in frontend code"), emergency alerts and SMS notifications are processed through a server-side route. It integrates SMS dispatch simulation with live status tracking (`Alert Sent ✓`, `Cooldown Active`, `Alert Failed ✕`) and supports external SMS providers (Twilio) via server environment variables (`TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID`, `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN`, `TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER`).

> [!NOTE]
> **Preserving Existing Features:** All current weather capabilities (30-minute auto caching, rain histogram, 24h & 7-day forecasts, radar map, favorite locations, and unit settings) remain 100% intact and operational.

